{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_849.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"635e43cf7135168f977652e4cdd4457042f7c7f7fc6b5040b1a3018d091b6b32","ja":"えれなんと歩、ダンス勝負してたよね？\n楽しそうでうらやましいな～。","zh":"艾雷娜和阿步刚才是在比拼舞蹈吧？\n看起来好开心，真让人羡慕啊～","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_849.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"fe397ddf7a76efb68c84b0316f09ff077a5d677598facdbaab44c8d3e52facb6","ja":"勝負……できてたのかな？\n歩が固まってた気もするけど……。","zh":"对决……算是完成了吗？\n感觉步好像都僵住了……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_849.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"40e7ef23610f8e534d9cac0a461c42d5fc8982f59629572a46216e72a0173022","ja":"でも、本番前にダンスでテンションあげてくのは\nいいかも。アタシたちも勝負、する？","zh":"不过，在正式演出前用舞蹈提升气氛，或许也不错。我们也来比一场？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_849.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"3c500c074f0490841b645791f08ed70c21143258b67ab529b0443073c58b7748","ja":"わあ、やるやる♪　それじゃあさっそく\n私から……ほらほらほらー♪","zh":"哇，好呀好呀♪ 那就马上从我开始……来嘛来嘛来嘛——♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_849.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"16474b5717ac885698a502eaea9d39d87e2ccf1259db33a6ed1792345b46d60c","ja":"のりさんが相手なら、\n思いっきり踊れるもんね！","zh":"对手是小乃的话，就能尽情跳舞了呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_849.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"4b8a61c7901e421553d540d36338eae568b989fc7a7da6481e25f1ced089862e","ja":"さすが海美、キレのある動きだね！\nよーし、大人組として相手を……。","zh":"不愧是海美，动作真利落！\n好，作为成熟组，就来对付对手……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_849.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"f43ddfd3f81201cabfbf2da24a7fb4bf37baafa490f70fd6eb653bbf9f210dfb","ja":"うっ！？","zh":"唔！？","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_849.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"e79fb42859b47485a60d0aa02842f19ce8f6cd2116e4b82fe01a0a45ca2ea058","ja":"ど、どうしたののりさん！？\n急に震えだして……。","zh":"怎、怎么了，法子！？\n突然开始发抖……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_849.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"a7de6b0874e0d90c69ac158260426e5e8471688c4ea62342a857c52129e189ed","ja":"あ、あっちの野外ステージ……プロレスやってる！！\nアタシの推しレスラーが、ちらって見えて……！","zh":"啊，那边的露天舞台……正在进行职业摔角比赛！！\n\n我推的摔角手刚才好像一闪而过……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_849.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"de42cd4e90882fd293e48af5e12a93b351b23c1ad40ca027c30e47ca43353662","ja":"どっ、どうしよう！？　き、緊張して、\nうまく踊るなんて……とても無理だよ……！","zh":"怎、怎么办！？我、我太紧张了，根本不可能顺利跳舞……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_849.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"b74f1ab4b63544564763a064a661a3ebd32da7c6c403fa1fbaa73d6c5996393b","ja":"おお、のりさんのもじもじしてる感じ……\nめっちゃ女子力を感じるよ！　あ、でも……。","zh":"喔，法子小姐那副扭扭捏捏的样子……感觉女子力超强的！啊，不过……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_849.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"88a8d5d92f87024372655678ed9100ebfeac0a70097f22540a9c9f159432d37d","ja":"ダンスで考えたら……勝負は\n私の勝ちってことになるのかな……？","zh":"如果按舞蹈来算……这场比试就算是我赢了吧……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
